{
  "key": 17195,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Our city was featured on a\n",
        "radio show.\r",
        "It’s nice to hear praise for your\n",
        "city, but it’s a bit embarrassing, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I went to the Gym, raring for battles\n",
        "against Trainers...\r",
        "It turns out, I stumbled into the\n",
        "unused Gym next door.\f",
        "Boy, I was pretty embarrassed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the house of the Copycat girl.\r",
        "She is so good at being a copycat\n",
        "of the way people talk that it’ll\f",
        "confuse you when you talk to her."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "The Copycat girl looked unhappy.\r",
        "She said she lost her cherished\n",
        "Poké Doll--CLEFAIRY."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Going into an alley for the first time\n",
        "makes me sorta anxious."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Chomp... Chew...\r",
        "The manager of the Power Plant\n",
        "used to be a repairman in a\f",
        "small factory.\r",
        "Chew... Chew...\r",
        "His hard work has taken him up the\n",
        "ladder to eventually become the\f",
        "manager of the Power Plant.\f",
        "Chew... Gulp...\r",
        "Quite impressive, don’t you think?\n",
        "Haaah, I’m full!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "This is Silph Co., famous for\n",
        "Pokémon merchandise.\r",
        "In the past, Team Rocket wanted the\n",
        "company because of that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a place called Trainer House\n",
        "in Viridian where Trainers gather from\f",
        "all over the place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "You came out from Johto?\r",
        "You can zip back home by hopping on\n",
        "the Magnet Train."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Kanto-Johto Magnet Train Line\n",
        "Saffron City Station"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron City\n",
        "Shining Big City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone Is Welcome!\n",
        "Fighting Dojo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Sabrina\f",
        "The Mistress of Psychic-Type Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Silph Co.\n",
        "Office Building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0529_T11_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Don’t Call Me Uncle Psychic!\n",
        "Mr. Psychic’s House"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
